# What Vercel does not need to build the site.
#
# Without this the CLI uploads every local build artifact: .next is 1.5 GB and
# the preview builds add another 1.2 GB. The deploy is the same either way; it
# just spends ten minutes uploading files the builder will throw away.
#
# Leading slashes matter. An unanchored `tools` also matched
# src/components/music-creator/tools, and the build failed on five imports.
/.next
/.next-*
/node_modules
/tools
/claude-home
/.data
/logs
/.playwright-mcp
/.claude
/runpod
/docs
/BighomieAI-Email-Setup
/item-storm-arena
/jarvis-uncensored
/dsh-browser-test
/shots-live
*.zip
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
tsconfig.check.tsbuildinfo
